{"title":"Shadow etcher","slug":"Shadow_etcher~4370","hero":{"file":"Screenshot_2025-08-18_234707-removebg-preview.webp","width":326,"height":765},"pageid":4370,"revid":21297,"timestamp":"2026-04-16T20:17:26Z","lastEditor":"MIRAHEZEISBETTERLOL","categories":["Axes","Tools"],"infobox":{"type":"Axe","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"The Void"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Darkling Drop"},{"label":"Swing Power","value":"0.8"},{"label":"Swing Distance","value":"18.75"},{"label":"Swing Time","value":"2.1875"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.90.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<p><i>\"forged from the essence of nothingness. Stronger against trees found in the void.\"</i>\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Not to be confused with the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Light_Etcher/\">Light Etcher</a>, the Shadow Etcher is a jet black axe rarely dropped from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Void/\">Axe Darklings</a> in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Void/\">The Void</a>. It has the special ability of doing considerably more damage to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Shadow_Tree/\">Shadow Trees</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Suiratcal/\">Suiratcal</a> trees in The Void.\n</p><p>The drop rate for Shadow Etcher is 2%, same as the Light Etcher.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"ability\">Ability</h3><p>\nWhen hitting a tree there is a chance for the ability to activate, this summons a black hole effect and makes the axe chop an additional time. </p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The Shadow Etchers ability going off\">The Shadow Etchers ability going off</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Shadowetchereffect.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The Shadow Etchers ability going off</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>","alias":{"of":"Shadow Etcher","slug":"Shadow_Etcher"}}
